      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO1 was triggered by the family's initial 'no fever/looks okay' framing and later by interim culture/lab uncertainty. The doctor repeatedly explained why these were useful but not exclusionary, and used serial temperature, feeding, urine, reaction, respiratory, and lab/culture monitoring to verify status.",
