          "explanation": "The doctor repaired the follow-up chain by identifying fallback services and telling the caregiver not to wait at home if the preferred clinic could not be accessed.",
          "quote": "如果挂不到新生儿科，挂同院儿科也可以"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_01064",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave a concrete escalation path if even pediatrics was unavailable.",
          "quote": "不要干等"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by uncertain follow-up and possible inability to secure neonatal review. The doctor converted the gap into a responsibility chain with preferred service, fallback same-hospital pediatrics, nurse triage, and timing.",
