        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_02093",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave an immediate emergency threshold rather than advising passive observation.",
          "quote": "有一条就要立刻去急诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Clear emergency thresholds were repeatedly provided, including respiratory distress, cyanosis, poor feeding, low urine, fever/low temperature, lethargy, seizures, worsening jaundice, and bilious/projectile vomiting.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "rc3_emergency_thresholds",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_02093",
          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly linked follow-up to neonatal/pediatric reassessment and possible CBC/CRP checks.",
          "quote": "复诊是不是要复查血常规和 CRP？"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor explained that infection could not be considered excluded merely because the infant looked stable and pushed for near-term original neonatal/pediatric follow-up and infection-related labs when indicated.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
