        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_02093",
          "explanation": "The doctor warned against caregiver self-medication with antibiotics.",
          "quote": "别打电话等"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The medication boundary was met: vitamin AD was explained as routine supplementation, not antimicrobial therapy, and the family was repeatedly told not to add antibiotics or other medicines without the original team.",
